    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LOCATION\r\nA superb location in the heart of Rathfarnham.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned on Loreto Avenue, this fine property enjoys an enviable setting within an established and mature residential neighbourhood close to the popular Loreto Park. The location offers an excellent balance of tranquility and convenience, with an exceptional range of amenities, recreational facilities, and transport links all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nNutgrove Shopping Centre and Retail Park are within comfortable walking distance, providing an extensive selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, and essential services. The property is also ideally located for access to the many amenities Rathfarnham, Dundrum and Churchtown have to offer.\r\n\r\nExcellent transport connections further enhance the appeal of the location. Numerous Dublin Bus routes operate nearby, while the Luas Green Line at Dundrum provides swift and convenient access towards Dublin city centre and surrounding areas. Dundrum Town Centre and the charming village of Dundrum are also just a short distance away, offering an outstanding choice of fashion, dining, entertainment, and leisure facilities.\r\n\r\nFor those commuting by car, the M50 is readily accessible, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin Airport, and Dublin city centre, and the wider road network.\r\n\r\nDESCRIPTION\r\nThis attractive two-storey mid-terrace home, built circa 1950, offers well-proportioned accommodation extending to approximately c.74.1 sq. m. / 797.6 sq. ft. and represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a home in this mature and highly regarded residential area of Rathfarnham.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is laid out over two floors and comprises, at ground floor level, an entrance hall, living room, kitchen, bathroom, and guest WC. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from gas-fired central heating and offers excellent potential for the new owner create a comfortable contemporary home tailored to their own requirements.\r\n\r\nTo the front, there is a garden with off-street parking, while the rear boasts a large private garden, providing generous outdoor space with considerable potential for landscaping, entertaining and family enjoyment.\r\n\r\nThe combination of a sought-after residential location, three-bedroom accommodation, off-street parking and a substantial rear garden makes this a property with considerable appeal and scope for further enhancement."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
