        "Content": "•\tTwo-storey mid-terrace house built circa 1950|\r\n•\tThree bedrooms\r\n•\tAccommodation extending to approximately c.74.1 sqm / 797.6 sqft\r\n•\tGas-fired central heating\r\n•\tFront garden with off-street parking\r\n•\tLarge private rear garden\r\n•\tExcellent potential to modernise and extend, subject to planning permission\r\n•\tMature and established residential location\r\n•\tConvenient to Loreto Park, Nutgrove Shopping Centre & Dundrum Shopping Centre\r\n•\tExcellent public transport links and easy access to the M50"
